sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant P0 as Web App
  participant Server
  participant DB
  participant Log
  User->>P0: open
  P0-)Server: fetch
  Server-->>P0: data
  alt cache hit
    Server->>Server: read cache
  else miss
    Server->>DB: query
    DB-->>Server: rows
  end
  Server->>Log: new
  Note over P0,Server: all HTTPS
  Note right of User: happy<br/>path
